flowchart TB
  U[用户或评委] --> FE[前端 Web UI\nweb/index.html]

  FE -->|上传病例| UP[/POST api upload/]
  FE -->|提问| CH[/POST api chat/]
  FE -->|看时间线| TL[/GET api session timeline/]
  FE -->|看审计| AU[/GET api audit/]

  subgraph API[FastAPI 服务层 app main]
    UP
    CH
    TL
    AU
  end

  subgraph INGEST[数据处理层]
    OCR[多模态解析 OCR\napp ocr and app llm]
    DEID[隐私脱敏\napp privacy]
    SPLIT[文本切片\napp rag]
    EVT[病程事件抽取\napp timeline]
  end

  UP --> OCR --> DEID --> SPLIT
  DEID --> EVT

  subgraph STORE[检索存储层]
    IVS[内部向量库 持久化]
    SVS[会话向量库 TTL]
    VEC[向量检索抽象\napp vector store]
  end

  SPLIT --> VEC
  VEC --> IVS
  VEC --> SVS
  TL --> EVT

  subgraph TIME[时序认知层]
    ENC[编码器路由\nlinear or ssm or mamba]
    MAMBA[Mamba 编码器\napp mamba encoder]
  end

  EVT --> ENC
  ENC --> MAMBA

  subgraph GEN[生成与可信层]
    RET[双库召回 TopK]
    LLM[对话生成模型 Qwen]
    GUARD[证据约束校验\napp evidence guard]
  end

  CH --> RET
  IVS --> RET
  SVS --> RET
  ENC --> RET
  RET --> LLM --> GUARD --> FE

  subgraph AUDIT[合规审计层]
    LOG[审计日志 JSONL\napp audit]
    TTLP[TTL 销毁证明]
  end

  UP --> LOG
  CH --> LOG
  SVS --> TTLP --> LOG
  AU --> LOG
